  "description": "Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage Open Beta Test - Now Live!\n\n■ Open Beta Test Schedule\n19 February 2026, 2:00 pm (AEDT) - 24 February 2026, 1:59 pm (AEDT)\n\nVirtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage takes the gameplay of Virtua Fighter 5 to new heights:\n\n-Rollback Netcode and Cross-play support let you take on any challenger, anywhere, across the globe in the most intense battles yet.\n\n-A brand-new single-player mode, \"World Stage\": Challenge powerful rivals on a solo quest to become the ultimate fighter\n\n-Enhanced replay functionality and improved training tools.\n\nNote:\nIn this open beta test, players can experience cross-play battles across platforms ahead of release. The purpose of the test is to verify online matchmaking functionality and identify any issues.\nPlease note that this is a development build, so unexpected bugs including game crashes may occur. We appreciate your understanding that we may not be able to guarantee a completely smooth gameplay experience.",
